ontent creation. From spontaneous selfies to professional livestreams, it's the ultimate tool for capturing life's best moments.<\/p><p><strong>Ultra-Portable Design<\/strong>Weighing just 49g, this magnetic cell phone stand folds down to a pocket-sized 120mm, making it lighter and more compact than most smartphones. Slip it into your bag or jacket for easy mobility - perfect for travel vlogging or outdoor adventures.<\/p><p><strong>Premium Durability<\/strong>This magnetic cell phone stand is made from aluminum alloy to provide stability. Its reinforced magnetic grip securely locks your device in place, even during action-packed shoots or windy outdoor streams.<\/p><p><strong>Smart, Versatile Design<\/strong>Get rid of disposable gear! Turn this magnetic cell phone stand into a desk stand, vlogging handle, video stabilizer, or streaming stand. Its adaptive design supports creative angles for TikTok dances, product reviews, or cinematic panning shots.<\/p><p><strong>Seamless Orientation Switching<\/strong>The magnetic cell phone stand switches between portrait and landscape modes thanks to its stabilizing magnetic attachments - perfect for Instagram Stories, YouTube tutorials. Magnetic attachments stay precisely in place without unwanted shifting.<\/p><p><strong>Universal Magnetic Compatibility<\/strong>The magnetic phone stand works perfectly with iPhone 12-16 series, MagSafe cases, and third-party magnetic accessories (using the included ring sticker). Perfect for live game streams, Zoom presentations, time-lapse photography, and hands-free content creation.<\/p><p><strong>Why creators love it:<\/strong>Whether you’re shooting a sunset reel, hosting a live Q&A, or capturing family memories, its magnetic phone tripod mount design ensures studio-quality results anywhere, empowering new creators and seasoned pros alike.Upgrade your toolkit today and make the phone stand your go-to stable tool for shooting anywhere<br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_o